      "idx": 0,
      "code": "TYPE ST_Pump :\nSTRUCT\n    priority : INT;\n    selection : BOOL;\n    RunComd : BOOL;\nEND_STRUCT\nEND_TYPE\n\nFUNCTION_BLOCK FB\nVAR_INPUT\n    mode : BOOL;\n    start : BOOL;\n    stop : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_IN_OUT\n    pumpGroup : ARRAY[1..5] OF ST_Pump;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    idx : ARRAY[1..5] OF INT;\n    i : INT;\n    j : INT;\n    temp : INT;\n    bestPos : INT;\nEND_VAR\n\nIF stop OR NOT start THEN\n    FOR i := 1 TO 5 DO\n        pumpGroup[i].RunComd := FALSE;\n    END_FOR\nELSIF NOT mode THEN\n    FOR i := 1 TO 5 DO\n        pumpGroup[i].RunComd := pumpGroup[i].selection;\n    END_FOR\nELSE\n    FOR i := 1 TO 5 DO\n        idx[i] := i;\n    END_FOR\n\n    FOR i := 1 TO 4 DO\n        bestPos := i;\n        FOR j := i + 1 TO 5 DO\n            IF (pumpGroup[idx[j]].priority > pumpGroup[idx[bestPos]].priority) OR\n               ((pumpGroup[idx[j]].priority = pumpGroup[idx[bestPos]].priority) AND (idx[j] < idx[bestPos])) THEN\n                bestPos := j;\n            END_IF\n        END_FOR\n        IF bestPos <> i THEN\n            temp := idx[i];\n            idx[i] := idx[bestPos];\n            idx[bestPos] := temp;\n        END_IF\n    END_FOR\n\n    FOR i := 1 TO 3 DO\n        pumpGroup[idx[i]].RunComd := TRUE;\n    END_FOR\n    FOR i := 4 TO 5 DO\n        pumpGroup[idx[i]].RunComd := FALSE;\n    END_FOR\nEND_IF\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
